<title>USA: Classic Restaurants seeks acquisitions.</title>
<headline>Classic Restaurants seeks acquisitions.</headline>
<dateline>NORCROSS, Ga. 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Classic Restaurants International said Wednesday that it had hired VenGua Capital Markets Ltd as an investment banker to help raise funds and find &quot;strategic acquisition&quot; candidates.</p>
<p>The holding company of Musicana Dinner Theatre restaurants in Florida said in a statement that it was in &quot;a strong acquisitive mode, seeking to build on its success through the addition of strategic businesses&quot;.</p>
</text>
